SUMMARY:Feast of the Dormition at the monastery\, Psara
LOCATION:Psara\, Psara\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:On the eve\, 14 August\, islanders and returning Psarians go up to the monastery of the Dormition for vespers\, after which the church serves chickpeas to the fasting pilgrims\; the party then moves to the old threshing floor\, where a small panigiri has been revived in recent years. A rare chance to see the island full\; boats from Chios are booked out that week.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/psara/#psara-feast-of-the-dormition-at-the-monastery-psara
